&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Engineering Services Support Engineer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Lead&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;da0c6ca9-a2f7-56ea-a648-1d3aabeb5ce1|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[469775450,&amp;quot;Lead&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;Lead&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,335551500,&amp;quot;6108695&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;23&amp;quot;,335551547,&amp;quot;1033&amp;quot;,335559740,&amp;quot;269&amp;quot;,201341983,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,335559739,&amp;quot;180&amp;quot;,201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;SIE is looking for a practical, curious Engineering Services Support Engineer to become the go-to person for technology support in our growing Dublin office. You will support &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Lead&quot;&gt;a small but growing team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Lead&quot;&gt; - primarily experienced software developers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Lead&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Lead&quot;&gt;while working as a fully integrated member of our Bristol-based IT T&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Lead&quot;&gt;eam&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Lead&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Lead&quot;&gt;This role will suit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Lead&quot;&gt;a self-starter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Lead&quot;&gt; who is excited by the autonomy and responsibility of owning a local IT environment while &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Lead&quot;&gt;remaining&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Lead&quot;&gt;closely connected&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Lead&quot;&gt; to an established team in Bristol.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:269}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
